[
  {
    "text": "I downloaded Little Universe because X Doctor had a podcast.",
    "startMs": 111,
    "endMs": 3694,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I'd watched their videos for ages, then searched the name here.",
    "startMs": 4153,
    "endMs": 7514,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I opened an episode about 2008, pressed play,",
    "startMs": 7986,
    "endMs": 11389,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and kept noticing things around the audio:",
    "startMs": 11708,
    "endMs": 14083,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "the notes, photos, and people talking below it.",
    "startMs": 14458,
    "endMs": 17583,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Let me show you.",
    "startMs": 18042,
    "endMs": 18750,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The player is pretty plain, which I like.",
    "startMs": 19222,
    "endMs": 21444,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The artwork is huge.",
    "startMs": 21917,
    "endMs": 23153,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "With that much space given to the cover, I look further down.",
    "startMs": 23625,
    "endMs": 27181,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "But the episode title and the controls stay easy to find.",
    "startMs": 27653,
    "endMs": 31236,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "This is the screen I actually use.",
    "startMs": 31708,
    "endMs": 33556,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "When I'm outside, I can leave it running in my pocket.",
    "startMs": 34028,
    "endMs": 36958,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If I miss something, the fifteen-second rewind is right by my thumb.",
    "startMs": 37417,
    "endMs": 41472,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I probably use that more than anything else.",
    "startMs": 41944,
    "endMs": 44208,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "After X Doctor, I started following topics, then other shows.",
    "startMs": 44667,
    "endMs": 48736,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I'd finish an episode and search for something it mentioned.",
    "startMs": 49208,
    "endMs": 52111,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes I browse a programme's older episodes.",
    "startMs": 52583,
    "endMs": 55472,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes I just pick something from the discovery page.",
    "startMs": 55944,
    "endMs": 58583,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Even Daqing came up \u2014 my hometown.",
    "startMs": 59042,
    "endMs": 61222,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I wasn't expecting that.",
    "startMs": 61681,
    "endMs": 62861,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Most of the time, the phone is back in my pocket anyway.",
    "startMs": 63319,
    "endMs": 66486,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "If I need to jump back in, there's usually a shortcut nearby.",
    "startMs": 66944,
    "endMs": 70319,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't need the full player every time.",
    "startMs": 70778,
    "endMs": 72792,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "The little player stays at the bottom while I browse.",
    "startMs": 73264,
    "endMs": 75972,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And if I missed something,",
    "startMs": 76444,
    "endMs": 77514,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm usually just trying to catch a sentence, not start over.",
    "startMs": 77958,
    "endMs": 81264,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Fifteen seconds back is enough for that.",
    "startMs": 81778,
    "endMs": 84056,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Here's where the 2008 episode gets more interesting.",
    "startMs": 84542,
    "endMs": 87667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I tap into its Show Notes.",
    "startMs": 88139,
    "endMs": 89639,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "First there's the episode outline,",
    "startMs": 90181,
    "endMs": 91986,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "with timestamps for different parts of the conversation.",
    "startMs": 92264,
    "endMs": 95208,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Then the notes move into photographs.",
    "startMs": 95667,
    "endMs": 97819,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "There's an image from the Beijing Olympics,",
    "startMs": 98292,
    "endMs": 100236,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and a photo of a DVD shop.",
    "startMs": 100472,
    "endMs": 102375,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "When someone talks about that time,",
    "startMs": 102833,
    "endMs": 104486,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I can actually see what they mean.",
    "startMs": 104931,
    "endMs": 106417,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I like being able to leave the audio alone",
    "startMs": 106875,
    "endMs": 109167,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and come back to these later.",
    "startMs": 109417,
    "endMs": 110778,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "A long episode can hold its references in one place,",
    "startMs": 111236,
    "endMs": 114528,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "instead of asking me to remember a name and search elsewhere.",
    "startMs": 114847,
    "endMs": 118458,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "And the conversation doesn't end with the hosts.",
    "startMs": 118917,
    "endMs": 121625,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I was at two minutes thirty-three when I took this screenshot.",
    "startMs": 122097,
    "endMs": 125125,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "From the episode page, I can open the discussion,",
    "startMs": 125639,
    "endMs": 128500,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and the comment box keeps that playback time beside it.",
    "startMs": 128819,
    "endMs": 131792,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Here, one listener writes about being a student in 2008.",
    "startMs": 132292,
    "endMs": 136153,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Another remembers the earthquake in Chengdu.",
    "startMs": 136611,
    "endMs": 139014,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I'll read a few, go back, and hear that part differently.",
    "startMs": 139472,
    "endMs": 142986,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "My profile shows 128 hours",
    "startMs": 143458,
    "endMs": 146194,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "and 27 minutes in total.",
    "startMs": 146208,
    "endMs": 147972,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "This sticker is different: a hundred hours with one creator.",
    "startMs": 148444,
    "endMs": 151944,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I like seeing which voices I've spent time with.",
    "startMs": 152417,
    "endMs": 154611,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't use it for everything.",
    "startMs": 155069,
    "endMs": 156278,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Most of my English podcasts are elsewhere.",
    "startMs": 156736,
    "endMs": 158958,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Web listening works, too, but I still reach for my phone.",
    "startMs": 159417,
    "endMs": 163028,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "For the Chinese podcasts I follow,",
    "startMs": 163514,
    "endMs": 165444,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "that's where Little Universe fits into my day.",
    "startMs": 165861,
    "endMs": 168167,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "I came here for X Doctor.",
    "startMs": 168639,
    "endMs": 170028,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "Now I come back for other shows,",
    "startMs": 170486,
    "endMs": 172361,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "the photos in the notes, and the people in the discussion.",
    "startMs": 172583,
    "endMs": 175500,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "There's a history of that on my profile.",
    "startMs": 175972,
    "endMs": 177819,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "When someone sends me an episode,",
    "startMs": 178278,
    "endMs": 179917,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "this is usually where I open it.",
    "startMs": 180319,
    "endMs": 182042,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  }
]